<title>UK: Compass confirms Accor sold 1.9 pct of stock.</title>
<headline>Compass confirms Accor sold 1.9 pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK catering group Compass Group Plc said on Tuesday that Accor SA sold six million shares, or 1.89 percent, of its stake in Compass in the market today.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the French hotel group now holds a 21.53 percent stake.</p>
<p>&quot;Accor intends to maintain an interest in Compass in the range of its present shareholding and considers Compass to be a long-term strategic investment for the Accor Group,&quot; Compass said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
